      "description": "The month as one picture: name, total, and the rolls on one floor.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-stage\"><h2 class=\"ds-stage-month\">September</h2><p class=\"ds-stage-total\">883,46 €</p><div class=\"ds-stage-floor\"><div class=\"ds-roll\"><svg width=\"64\" height=\"66\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 66\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><ellipse cx=\"32\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"26\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"rgb(0 0 0 / 0.12)\"/><rect x=\"6\" y=\"2\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#6C8EEA\"/><g transform=\"translate(12 12)\"><ellipse cx=\"14\" cy=\"10.4\" rx=\"2.6\" ry=\"3\" fill=\"#2E3A8C\"/><ellipse cx=\"26\" cy=\"9.8\" rx=\"2.4\" ry=\"2.8\" fill=\"#2E3A8C\"/><path d=\"M13 17.5 Q20 24.5 27 17\" stroke=\"#2E3A8C\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></g></svg><span class=\"ds-roll-name\">Groceries</span><span class=\"ds-roll-amount\">51,20 €</span></div><div class=\"ds-roll\"><svg width=\"64\" height=\"94\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 94\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><ellipse cx=\"32\" cy=\"88\" rx=\"26\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"rgb(0 0 0 / 0.12)\"/><rect x=\"6\" y=\"2\" width=\"52\" height=\"80\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#E2553B\"/><g transform=\"translate(12 12)\"><ellipse cx=\"14\" cy=\"10.4\" rx=\"2.6\" ry=\"3\" fill=\"#F6F2EA\"/><ellipse cx=\"26\" cy=\"9.8\" rx=\"2.4\" ry=\"2.8\" fill=\"#F6F2EA\"/><path d=\"M13 17.5 Q20 24.5 27 17\" stroke=\"#F6F2EA\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></g></svg><span class=\"ds-roll-name\">Eating out</span><span class=\"ds-roll-amount\">159,16 €</span></div><div class=\"ds-roll\"><svg width=\"64\" height=\"134\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 134\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><ellipse cx=\"32\" cy=\"128\" rx=\"26\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"rgb(0 0 0 / 0.12)\"/><rect x=\"6\" y=\"2\" width=\"52\" height=\"120\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#3F9A55\"/><g transform=\"translate(12 12)\"><ellipse cx=\"14\" cy=\"10.4\" rx=\"2.6\" ry=\"3\" fill=\"#F6F2EA\"/><ellipse cx=\"26\" cy=\"9.8\" rx=\"2.4\" ry=\"2.8\" fill=\"#F6F2EA\"/><path d=\"M13 17.5 Q20 24.5 27 17\" stroke=\"#F6F2EA\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></g></svg><span class=\"ds-roll-name\">Home</span><span class=\"ds-roll-amount\">588,70 €</span></div></div></section>",
